s from 1951 to 2025, and on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 6 grids April to May came in under 90% of normal in 35 of them. In 2025 the middle got 148% of normal in April to May and only 55% in November to December. In 2026 January to February came in at 39% on the middle. Grid 21771 had its driest year in 1953 at 64%.</p>"}
